      "writtenOn": "2021-09-03T11:19:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "suggest using .get(appId, NONE) to clarify that you want to get NONE if it\u0027s not in the map. Otherwise you rely on the implicit assumption that SparseIntArray#get(int) returns 0, and that NONE \u003d\u003d 0.",
